Translation patch: <Poly>::from_complete_points

Change: the `iter().map(..).collect()` and `iter().enumerate().map(..).collect()` chains become
index loops that push into vectors.
Why: iterator adapters (`map`, `enumerate`, `collect`) are not modelled by the Aeneas Lean library
(aeneas#1043).
Behaviour: identical.

diff --git a/src/encoding/polynomial.rs b/src/encoding/polynomial.rs
index 03315cd..237c733 100644
